OL,3,GNEWSASong urges builders to talk about
OL,4,Amental health
OL,5,
OL,6,FA construction company manager is using
OL,7,Fmusic as a way of getting more men in
OL,8,Fthe industry talking about their mental
OL,9,Fhealth following the loss of his uncle.
OL,11,FBen Francis, from Bruton, Somerset, has
OL,12,Fwritten a song as a way of raising
OL,13,Fawareness and money for mental health
OL,14,Fcharities after his uncle, Jonathan
OL,15,FCarpenter, took his own life in
OL,16,FDecember 2023.
OL,18,FJonathan was a "meticulous carpenter"
OL,19,Fand Francis hopes his uncle's story and
OL,20,Fhis song will strike a cord with fellow
OL,21,Fconstruction workers and encourage them
OL,22,Fto open up about their mental health.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
